      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by uncertain oxygen readings, changing oxygen support, and later ambiguous blood-gas interpretation. The doctor repeatedly asked for current measurements and context, explained why single values or surface improvement could be misleading, and tied verification to monitored-care and escalation decisions.",
