          "quote": "犯困、打哈欠、叫她反应变慢"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 is met. The doctor asked for oxygenation and medication context and repeatedly set escalation thresholds for worsening dyspnea, low saturation, altered responsiveness, vomiting, and cyanosis.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
