      "explanation": "RC5 is met on the visible evidence. The doctor did not make the usual inhaler a substitute for monitored oxygen care and later explicitly prevented use of uncertain home nebulizer medicines; the specific tetanus/analgin allergy discrepancy was not surfaced to the doctor in visible tool results or family messages, so its non-mention is not counted as an actionable omission.",
